<title>USA: WHX evaluating Dynamics options.</title>
<headline>WHX evaluating Dynamics options.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>WHX Corp said Wednesday it is evaluating its options with respect to Dynamics Corp of America, which is resisting a takeover by the big steel producer.</p>
<p>On Monday Dynamics said it had agreed to be acquired by CTS Corp for $55 per share in cash and CTS stock.</p>
<p>WHX has offered $45 cash per share for Dynamics.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
